# The selector of the executor module of the tiered executor
# (gezi.contest.modules.solo.TieringModule, project
# contest-modules-solo-tiering): the one field of this file's tuple, a closed
# term told apart from every other module's selector by its synthetic label,
# which the host never reads. The module registers
# this file's path and an entry imports this file, so that the two selectors
# are one interned instruction.
λ export
. export λ. (λ"$tiering". λx. x) "$tiering"
